==Rolling Stock==
* [[Okami Metro 30000 series|30000 series]] (8-car sets):
*: The primary fleet for the Nanboku Line. Unlike other metro stocks, these are equipped with pantographs for overhead catenary power collection.
* [[Akitetsu]] 5000 series:
*: Used for through-services from the north.
* [[Tokutetsu]] 2200 series:
*: Used for through-services from the south.
